    "name": "Ladder it Up!",
    "steam_appid": 2996770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/3bd6488a92a1c8e50656b9cfaca2d036.avif?t=1723631663\" width=593 height=118 /></span><br><br>Take on a challenge that tests your patience and perseverance as you climb to the top of the tower, uncovering its secrets. Use your ladder to overcome obstacles that will come on your way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/02fe3ff0c6e1b2faad364a9b393ee201.poster.avif?t=1723631663\" width=384 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/02fe3ff0c6e1b2faad364a9b393ee201.webm?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/02fe3ff0c6e1b2faad364a9b393ee201.mp4?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Visit various locations on your way to the top. Crystal caves, volcanoes, and icy crevices are just a few of the places you'll traverse to reach the tower.<br><br>The game includes 12 sub-levels on the normal difficulty level, leading you to the tower, and a hidden level that offers a different reward and new environment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/bd15ca904e9e965318736b3620010b49.poster.avif?t=1723631663\" width=384 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/bd15ca904e9e965318736b3620010b49.webm?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/bd15ca904e9e965318736b3620010b49.mp4?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Each fall is a valuable lesson needed to become better. The game will test your analytical thinking, observational skills, and determination. Will you give up, or will you climb up to the top?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/0e7bfca9281b47d1adcbb07b0bc51643.poster.avif?t=1723631663\" width=384 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/0e7bfca9281b47d1adcbb07b0bc51643.webm?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/0e7bfca9281b47d1adcbb07b0bc51643.mp4?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Three difficulty levels offering different experiences!<br><br>\ud83d\udfe2 Easy - For beginners or those who don't like challenges. The level is shortened, you can retrieve your ladder frequently, lava doesn't burn items, there are plenty of checkpoints, and there are no collectibles or ladder customization options. Good for learning the route in a more relaxed way.<br><br>\ud83d\udfe1 Medium - The author's original vision. Normal level length with more demanding gameplay. Significantly fewer checkpoints, fewer places to renew the ladder, crystals are consumable, collectibles, secrets, rewards for completing the game, and ladder customization are available.<br><br>\ud83d\udd34 Hard - Only for the determined. No checkpoints, no crystals, no places to renew the ladder, and lots of lava. Each failure means starting over from the very beginning. This mode is unforgiving. One wrong move, and you start from the beginning.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/59735cb5d13f2357e66c67f324fa01d4.poster.avif?t=1723631663\" width=384 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/59735cb5d13f2357e66c67f324fa01d4.webm?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Collect hidden items in the world to unlock new visuals for your ladder. The game features 4 basic ladders, 5 to be found, and 3 to be unlocked by completing specific levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/5e03a3ba6e766f5d35d0be99808ee381.poster.avif?t=1723631663\" width=384 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/5e03a3ba6e766f5d35d0be99808ee381.webm?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/5e03a3ba6e766f5d35d0be99808ee381.mp4?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After completing each level, you can see the time it took you to finish. Not satisfied with your result? Improve it! The leaderboard updates only with your fastest completion time for each difficulty level.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/3bd6488a92a1c8e50656b9cfaca2d036.avif?t=1723631663\" width=593 height=118 /></span><br><br>Take on a challenge that tests your patience and perseverance as you climb to the top of the tower, uncovering its secrets. Use your ladder to overcome obstacles that will come on your way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/02fe3ff0c6e1b2faad364a9b393ee201.poster.avif?t=1723631663\" width=384 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/02fe3ff0c6e1b2faad364a9b393ee201.webm?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/02fe3ff0c6e1b2faad364a9b393ee201.mp4?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Visit various locations on your way to the top. Crystal caves, volcanoes, and icy crevices are just a few of the places you'll traverse to reach the tower.<br><br>The game includes 12 sub-levels on the normal difficulty level, leading you to the tower, and a hidden level that offers a different reward and new environment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/bd15ca904e9e965318736b3620010b49.poster.avif?t=1723631663\" width=384 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/bd15ca904e9e965318736b3620010b49.webm?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/bd15ca904e9e965318736b3620010b49.mp4?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Each fall is a valuable lesson needed to become better. The game will test your analytical thinking, observational skills, and determination. Will you give up, or will you climb up to the top?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/0e7bfca9281b47d1adcbb07b0bc51643.poster.avif?t=1723631663\" width=384 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/0e7bfca9281b47d1adcbb07b0bc51643.webm?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/0e7bfca9281b47d1adcbb07b0bc51643.mp4?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Three difficulty levels offering different experiences!<br><br>\ud83d\udfe2 Easy - For beginners or those who don't like challenges. The level is shortened, you can retrieve your ladder frequently, lava doesn't burn items, there are plenty of checkpoints, and there are no collectibles or ladder customization options. Good for learning the route in a more relaxed way.<br><br>\ud83d\udfe1 Medium - The author's original vision. Normal level length with more demanding gameplay. Significantly fewer checkpoints, fewer places to renew the ladder, crystals are consumable, collectibles, secrets, rewards for completing the game, and ladder customization are available.<br><br>\ud83d\udd34 Hard - Only for the determined. No checkpoints, no crystals, no places to renew the ladder, and lots of lava. Each failure means starting over from the very beginning. This mode is unforgiving. One wrong move, and you start from the beginning.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/59735cb5d13f2357e66c67f324fa01d4.poster.avif?t=1723631663\" width=384 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/59735cb5d13f2357e66c67f324fa01d4.webm?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Collect hidden items in the world to unlock new visuals for your ladder. The game features 4 basic ladders, 5 to be found, and 3 to be unlocked by completing specific levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/5e03a3ba6e766f5d35d0be99808ee381.poster.avif?t=1723631663\" width=384 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/5e03a3ba6e766f5d35d0be99808ee381.webm?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996770/extras/5e03a3ba6e766f5d35d0be99808ee381.mp4?t=1723631663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After completing each level, you can see the time it took you to finish. Not satisfied with your result? Improve it! The leaderboard updates only with your fastest completion time for each difficulty level.",
